Description: JavaScript runtime, bundler, test runner and package manager
 Bun runs JavaScript and TypeScript on JavaScriptCore and aims to be a drop-in
 replacement for Node.js. The one binary also bundles code, runs tests and
 installs npm packages.
 .
 This package contains upstream's release binary, unchanged. Update it with
 apt, not with "bun upgrade".
